OL,3,GNEWSAInquest for man shot seven times
OL,4,Aby police reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has been told a man
OL,7,Fdied when he was shot seven times by
OL,8,Ftwo armed police officers.
OL,10,FSergii Kuzmenko, a Ukrainian who "spoke
OL,11,Flimited English", was killed by Cumbria
OL,12,FPolice officers responding to reports
OL,13,Fof a man making threats to kill while a
OL,14,Fyoung child was present.
OL,16,FIt happened at a house on Borland
OL,17,FAvenue in Carlisle on 19 December 2022
OL,18,Fand followed a 999 call from the man's
OL,19,Fsister.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
