OL,3,GNEWSAInquest for man shot seven times
OL,4,Aby police reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Kirsty Gomersal reopened
OL,7,FKuzmenko's inquest in Workington on
OL,8,FMonday and told told the jury there
OL,9,Fwould be an examination of the use of
OL,10,Ffirearms and police policy for
OL,11,Finteracting with people whose first
OL,12,Flanguage is not English.
